WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.204
Doctors, pharmacists and optometrists:

2
00:00:03.204 --> 00:00:04.683
due to revalidate?

3
00:00:04.683 --> 00:00:08.300
Here's exactly what your regulator asks for.

4
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.318
Doctors usually revalidate every five years.

5
00:00:11.318 --> 00:00:16.800
You need an annual appraisal, and your responsible officer makes your recommendation.

6
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.206
Bring six types of evidence to your appraisals:

7
00:00:20.206 --> 00:00:28.100
CPD, quality improvement, significant events, patient feedback, colleague feedback, and complaints and compliments.

8
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.350
Pharmacists submit six records every year:

9
00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:36.100
four CPD records, one peer discussion and one reflective account.

10
00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:50.200
Optometrists need thirty-six CPD points by the end of twenty twenty-seven, including eighteen from interactive CPD, plus a peer review, a reflective exercise and a personal development plan.

11
00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.461
Who's revalidating this year?

12
00:00:52.461 --> 00:01:01.000
Share your top tip below, and apply to join the Igbo Healthcare Professionals Network, IHPN-UK, at the link in our bio.
